ding","tags":[],"url":"/ja/changelog#bug-fixes","content":"Bug Fixes"},"10":{"id":"/ja/changelog-8","page_id":"/ja/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/changelog#100--2024-09-17","content":"1.0.0 — 2024-09-17"},"11":{"id":"/ja/changelog-9","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes","content":"**Migrated to the Unity IAP v5 store API.** Requires `com.unity.purchasing` &#x2A;*5.3.0+**."},"12":{"id":"/ja/changelog-10","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes","content":"The legacy `IStoreController` / `IExtensionProvider` / `IStoreListener` model was replaced with `UnityIAPServices.StoreController()` and its event-based API (`OnPurchasePending`, `OnPurchaseConfirmed`, `OnProductsFetched`, `OnPurchasesFetched`, …)."},"13":{"id":"/ja/changelog-11","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes","content":"Initialization now runs `Connect()` → `FetchProducts(List<ProductDefinition>)` → `FetchPurchases()` instead of `ConfigurationBuilder` + `UnityPurchasing.Initialize`."},"14":{"id":"/ja/changelog-12","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes","content":"Purchases are now confirmed against an **order**: `Confirm(Product)` is removed in favor of `Confirm(PendingOrder)`. `Confirm(PurchaseResult)` is unchanged."},"15":{"id":"/ja/changelog-13","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes","content":"Removed the internal `InitializeResult` type."},"16":{"id":"/ja/changelog-14","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"`PurchaseResult.Order` (`PendingOrder`), plus convenience `Receipt` and `TransactionId` accessors sourced from `Order.Info`."},"17":{"id":"/ja/changelog-15","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"`PurchaseType.Deferred` for purchases awaiting external approval (e.g. Ask to Buy)."},"18":{"id":"/ja/changelog-16","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"Non-generic `Task.Timeout` overload to support awaiting `StoreController.Connect()`."},"19":{"id":"/ja/changelog-17","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#notes","content":"The high-level API (`InitializeAsync`, `PurchaseAsync`, `Confirm(PurchaseResult)`, `GetPendingList`, `Restore`) is source-compatible with 2.0.0."},"20":{"id":"/ja/changelog-18","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes-1","content":"**Unity IAP 5.0.0+ required.** v4 and below are no longer supported."},"21":{"id":"/ja/changelog-19","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes-1","content":"Removed `OnInitializeFailed(InitializationFailureReason)` overload (no-message variant removed in IAP v5)."},"22":{"id":"/ja/changelog-20","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#breaking-changes-1","content":"Removed `OnPurchaseFailed(Product, PurchaseFailureReason)` overload (replaced by `PurchaseFailureDescription` in IAP v5)."},"23":{"id":"/ja/changelog-21","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#bug-fixes","content":"Fixed `NullReferenceException` caused by `initializeCompletionSource` never being initialized before `UnityPurchasing.Initialize` was called."},"24":{"id":"/ja/changelog-22","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#bug-fixes","content":"Fixed inverted `_isInitialized` guard in `GetPendingList` and `PurchaseAsync` — both methods were blocking when initialized and allowing calls when not."},"25":{"id":"/ja/changelog-23","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#bug-fixes","content":"Fixed missing `return` in `PurchaseAsync` after an early-exit error result."},"26":{"id":"/ja/changelog-24","page_id